# The Moonlit Path (windurst 9): the Dark Mana Orb's operands for a Windurst char. Rank 9 with The Promise completed:
# option 6 (15000 gil), completed, no orb (the rank half). A day on: 848 option 2; rank 10 (GM) and The Promise taken
# away (GM): 850, option 5 (the Ancient's Key), no orb (the Promise half). A day on: 848 option 2; The Promise completed
# (GM): 850, option 4 (Fenrir's Earring), the orb. The nation half alone (a char of another nation at Windurst rank 10,
# with The Promise) is #nation: a Windurst char at rank 10 changes its nation at Mythily before the turn-in.
lists WindurstWaters/Leepe-Hoppe/onTrigger WindurstWaters/onEventFinish/846 WindurstWaters/onEventFinish/850
char zone=WindurstWaters pos=11.4,-9.75,-195.97 nation=2
rank 9
fame Windurst 425
quest Windurst.TheMoonlitPath accepted
quest Windurst.ThePromise completed
keyitem WhisperOfTheMoon
login
trigger Leepe-Hoppe                     # 846 (mask 192)
finish option=6                         # 15000 gil; completed; rank 9: no orb
wait jst=1
trigger Leepe-Hoppe                     # 848
finish option=2                         # begun again, the bauble, Repeat 1
delkeyitem MoonBauble
keyitem WhisperOfTheMoon
rank 10
quest Windurst.ThePromise available
trigger Leepe-Hoppe                     # 850 (mask 192)
finish option=5                         # the Ancient's Key; completed; rank 10 without The Promise: no orb
wait jst=1
trigger Leepe-Hoppe                     # 848
finish option=2                         # begun again, the bauble, Repeat 1
delkeyitem MoonBauble
keyitem WhisperOfTheMoon
quest Windurst.ThePromise completed
trigger Leepe-Hoppe                     # 850 (mask 208: the Ancient's Key held, bit 4)
finish option=4                         # Fenrir's Earring; completed; Windurst, rank 10, The Promise: the Dark Mana Orb
